    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_industrial_minerals; processing_state=unspecified; wd_term=graphite; wd_relation=skos:broadMatch): Black lead / plumbago is graphite (Simmonds 1892 s.v. BLACK LEAD: 'See GRAPHITE and PLUMBAGO'; McCulloch 1880 s.v. BLACK LEAD); filed with Plumbago (htc:0130), not with lead metal or metallic ores. Layer-1 observations: 9 rows, 1881–1901. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×3; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×5. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×8; (no unit) ×1. Top routes: Canada → United States ×2; Ontario → United States ×1; Canada → United Kingdom ×1; Canada → World ×1."@en ;
